cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Agentic AI Logistics Control Tower: dependence-aware localisation of
  route-estimate error in road freight, with a measured agent layer
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite it using the
  metadata below. Please also cite the Delhivery dataset separately —
  see DATA_LICENSE.md.
type: software
